},
},
["internalVersion"] = 90,
["selfPoint"] = "CENTER",
["desc"] = "Seal Twist Swing Timer by Surveillant\n(includes Wild Strikes fix)\n\nThe idea behind this swing timer is that it should hopefully help you seal twist with your peripheral vision, preventing the need to stare at your swing timer all the time. \n\nBar Colors:\nBlue = Filler Window\nRed = Danger Zone (don't cast here!)\nGreen = Twisting Window (400ms)\n\nTicks:\nRed Tick: Denotes the end of the Filler Window; if you cast a GCD after this point, it will interfere with your upcoming seal twist. \nGreen Tick 1: Denotes the beginning of the Twist Window\nGreen Tick 2: Halfway point of Twist Window; this is where you twist when you want to \"cancel judge\"\n\nTHIS DOES NOT WORK WITH TIER 1 6P BONUS, OR TIER 2 CORE FORGED 6P BONUS. YOU NEED THE DUAL SEAL SWING TIMER FOR THAT. \n\nIncludes a single seal indicator to track seals. A dual seal version is also available on the Wago for Tier 1 6P or Tier 2 Core Forged 6P bonuses. ",
