{
["type"] = "description",
["text"] = "How-to-Use:\n\n- Mark mobs on Mouseover by holding the assigned Keybind below.\n- Marks will be locked after being Marked until the Mob dies.\n\nYou can RIGHT CLICK on the Widget to completely clear all Marks at any time.\n\nOptional Macro:\n\n- Remove all marks from the widget and clear any marked mobs:\n/run WeakAuras.ScanEvents(\"WA_FJIAM_RESET\", true)",
["fontSize"] = "medium",
["width"] = 2,
},
