{
["type"] = "description",
["fontSize"] = "medium",
["text"] = "Once set, type !cube in Raid Chat to send the Team(s) to your Raid Group. You must have Raid Leader, and players must have their WeakAuras window closed to receive. Both the sender and receivers must be inside Magtheridon's Lair.",
